<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<package xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/packaging/2013/05/nuspec.xsd">
  <metadata>
    <id>TokenVector.Data</id>
    <version>1.0.5-dev</version>
    <title>TokenVector.Data - High-Performance Columnar DataFrame &amp; Tabular Engine (TokenVector Language)</title>
    <authors>TokenVector Project Team</authors>
    <license type="expression">MIT</license>
    <licenseUrl>https://licenses.nuget.org/MIT</licenseUrl>
    <readme>README.md</readme>
    <releaseNotes>1.0.5-dev: narrow dtype system (v1.8). series_astype/series_to_narrow for i8/i16/i32/u8/u16/u32/u64 (clamp semantics), f32, datetime64 (epoch-ms tag); core Series/Col auto-widen via get_i64/get_f64/get_string, clone/slice/take preserve the narrow tag; csv_read_ex dtypes_spec accepts i8/i16/i32/u8/u16/u32/u64/f32/datetime64 (datetime64 parses ISO via dt_parse, null-safe masks). New df_sort_index_cols (axis=1), groupby_group_keys/groupby_group (iterating groups, single or multi key). Parquet/Feather documented as blocked-by-compiler (no bitwise R5, no binary file IO primitive). Suites: p2_check 154/154, 17/17 legacy green, DLL smoke 28/28 symbols.</releaseNotes>
    <description>High-performance columnar DataFrame and tabular data processing library, natively implemented in the TokenVector language (tkv) and compiled to a .NET CIL DLL: schema, columns, series, vector math, filter, group-by, joins (incl. AsOf), pivot/melt, CSV/JSON IO, Arrow IPC stream and out-of-core batches, zero-copy Mat bridge for numerics.</description>
    <tags>dataframe columnar arrow feather csv json timeseries asofjoin tokenvector data</tags>
    <dependencies>
      <group targetFramework="net8.0" />
    </dependencies>
  </metadata>
</package>
